---
accTitle: The bounded-context dependency graph
---
flowchart BT
    SK[SharedKernel<br/>Result · DomainError · Specification]
    SKILL[Skill Domain<br/>three skill sources]
    TOOL[Tool Domain<br/>32 tools · seam interfaces]
    CONV[Conversation Domain<br/>message aggregate]
    MODEL[Model Domain<br/>IModelProvider seam]
    CAP[Capability Domain<br/>merged registry]
    STATE[State Domain<br/>keys + evidence]
    PLAN[Plan Domain<br/>structured plans]
    MEM[Memory Domain<br/>recall + curated memory]
    AGENT[Agent Domain<br/>the loop · sub-agents]
    APP[Agent Application<br/>handlers · watchdog loop]

    SKILL --> SK
    TOOL --> SK
    TOOL --> SKILL
    CONV --> SK
    CONV --> TOOL
    MODEL --> SK
    MODEL --> CONV
    MODEL --> TOOL
    CAP --> SK
    CAP --> TOOL
    STATE --> SK
    STATE --> CAP
    PLAN --> SK
    PLAN --> CAP
    MEM --> SK
    MEM --> CAP
    AGENT --> SK
    AGENT --> MODEL
    AGENT --> CONV
    AGENT --> CAP
    AGENT --> TOOL
    APP --> AGENT
    APP --> MEM
    APP --> MODEL
